        "statement": "As a result, we are required to maintain a Federal Firearms License (\"FFL\") and Special Occupational Tax (\"SOT\") registration to manufacture and distribute these products.",
        "start_character": 34389,
        "end_character": 34560
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-011401",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-011401-d03b363e3446564a",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-011401",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Most correctional facilities fall under federal, state, or local jurisdiction and we believe these facilities represent a meaningful market for our products and services, including the use of Wrap Reality for law enforcement and societal reentry training, WrapTactics for officer readiness and skill retention, BolaWrap for use within and around correctional environments, and WrapVision body-worn cameras and our digital evidence management platform to support transparency, incident documentation, and evidentiary requirements within correctional settings.",
        "start_character": 10300,
        "end_character": 10858
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-011401",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-011401-d03b363e3446564a",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-011401",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These regulations affect multiple aspects of our business, including product classification and licensing, manufacturing, export and import controls, data privacy and security, drone operations, defense procurement, and workplace safety and environmental compliance.",
        "start_character": 33759,
        "end_character": 34025
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-011401",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-011401-d03b363e3446564a",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-011401",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through WrapVision, our body-worn camera, and our cloud-based digital evidence management platform, we are building a standalone product line that also complements our core non-lethal solutions portfolio.",
        "start_character": 41237,
        "end_character": 41441
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-011401",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-011401-d03b363e3446564a",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-011401",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We acquired W1 to integrate technology enablement into its core offerings and expand into managed technology services supporting the BolaWrap go-to market strategy.",
        "start_character": 4224,
        "end_character": 4388
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-011401",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-011401-d03b363e3446564a",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-011401",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also focus on manufacturing process improvements and design changes intended to reduce production costs, improve product reliability, and enhance manufacturability.",
        "start_character": 48214,
        "end_character": 48381
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-011401",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-011401-d03b363e3446564a",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-011401",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are committed to strengthening our domestic manufacturing footprint and supply chain as part of our broader strategy to support Made in America production across our product portfolio.",
        "start_character": 27934,
        "end_character": 28121
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-011401",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-011401-d03b363e3446564a",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-011401",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are executing this strategy through a combination of expanding our core BolaWrap business, developing and scaling new product lines and service offerings, growing recurring revenue through subscription-based platforms, entering adjacent markets through dedicated federal and defense initiatives, and expanding our international presence.",
        "start_character": 39087,
        "end_character": 39427
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-011401",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-011401-d03b363e3446564a",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-011401",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that maintaining scalable, domestically based assembly and manufacturing capabilities is critical to the performance of our products, the growth of our business, and our ability to meet the procurement requirements of federal, defense, and international customers.",
