        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We conduct research and development (\"R&D\") on an ongoing basis to enhance our existing products, develop new applications for our core technologies, advance emerging technology programs, and improve manufacturing efficiency and product reliability.",
